Evaluation reports from the work record

Usage: instrukt eval <COMMAND>

Commands:
  report  Write an HTML report of delivery outcomes from the work record, by project and evaluation
          window, with the model a separate dimension
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
